      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel this should and would be attached to Google Drive or some other Cloud service instead, so world creators don't get access to a users computer but can save and load data through an external service that the player can still access (easy cache deletion or modification).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
